  "correctValue": null,
  "solution": {
    "text": "According to molecular orbital theory, outer configuration for\r\n$$\r\n\\left[\\mathrm{C}_{2}\\right]=\\mathrm{C}_{12} \\rightarrow \\pi p_{x}^{2}=\\pi p_{y}^{2}\r\n$$\r\nThus, is diamagnetic in nature.\r\n$$\r\n\\left[\\mathrm{B}_{2}\\right]=\\mathrm{B}_{10}->\\pi p_{x}^{1}=\\pi p_{y}^{1}\r\n$$\r\nThus, is paramagnetic in nature.",
